# architect-skill — repository

Skill library + custom agent library for Cursor and Copilot. Work in this clone to edit `skills/`, `agents/`, `office-tools`, scripts, or docs.

**Install or patch (global default):** after skill or agent changes — or when the user asks — run `bash scripts/install_library.sh` from the repo root. Do not only edit source folders. See [architect-skill-patch.mdc](architect-skill-patch.mdc) and [docs/AGENT-SKILL-INSTALL.md](docs/AGENT-SKILL-INSTALL.md).

## Layout

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `skills/` | Skill library source → `~/.cursor/skills/`, `~/.copilot/skills/` |
| `agents/` | Custom agent library source → `~/.cursor/agents/`, `~/.copilot/agents/` |
| `agents/<name>/INSTRUCTIONS.md` | Shared agent prompt body |
| `agents/<name>/cursor.header.md` | Cursor frontmatter (assembled at install) |
| `agents/<name>/copilot.header.md` | Copilot frontmatter (assembled at install) |
| `skills/excalidraw-diagram/` | Excalidraw → PNG visual QA |
| `skills/word-document/` | DOCX architecture documents |
| `skills/powerpoint-presentation/` | PPTX → **mandatory** layout preview |
| `skills/spreadsheet-document/` | XLSX / spreadsheets; formula recalc via office-tools |
| `skills/pdf-document/` | PDF read/create/merge/forms |
| `skills/_shared/` | `architecture-document-principles.md`, `office-tools/` |
| `scripts/install_library.sh` | Install/patch both libraries (global default) |
| `scripts/install_deps.sh` | Runtimes only (`all` \| `excalidraw` \| `office` \| `office-system` \| `pdf`) |
| `.cursor/rules/` | **Maintainer rules for this repo** — not copied to users |
| `docs/AGENT-SKILL-INSTALL.md` | End-user install guide |
| `docs/MAINTAINING-SKILLS.md` | Maintainer checklist (skills + agents) |
| `docs/AGENTS.md` | Agent catalog |

Skill behavior: `skills/<name>/SKILL.md` and `skills/<name>/references/`.

## Changing this repo

Do **not** update only scripts or README. When adding or changing a skill, agent, workflow step, or dependency:

1. Follow [docs/MAINTAINING-SKILLS.md](docs/MAINTAINING-SKILLS.md).
2. **Skill change** → update `skills/*/SKILL.md`, execution rule row, `SKILL_BUNDLE` in `install_library.sh` if new skill, run `bash scripts/install_library.sh skills`.
3. **Agent change** → update `agents/<name>/`, [docs/AGENTS.md](docs/AGENTS.md), `AGENT_BUNDLE` in `install_library.sh` if new agent, run `bash scripts/install_library.sh agents`.
4. Always update `README.md`, `docs/AGENT-SKILL-INSTALL.md`, and relevant `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`.

**Do not:**

- Copy `skills/` into `repo/.cursor/skills/`.
- Copy `agents/` into `repo/.cursor/agents/` or `repo/.github/agents/` as canonical source.
- Add agents to `SKILL_BUNDLE` or skills to `AGENT_BUNDLE`.

Install bundles for users: run `bash scripts/install_library.sh` (skills + agents globally by default).
